flowchart TB
  INPUT[Training request + versioned dataset + baseline YAML] --> VALID[Config validator + SHA256]
  VALID --> KFP[Kubeflow Pipelines v2 - future orchestration]
  KFP --> OPT{HPO backend}
  OPT -->|Primary| KAT[Kubeflow Katib]
  OPT -->|Optional alternative| RAY[Ray Tune]
  KAT --> TRAIN[PyTorch / Hugging Face Meta Llama LoRA training]
  RAY --> TRAIN
  TRAIN --> OBS[Evaluation callbacks + MLflow tracking]
  OBS --> DET[Deterministic metrics diagnosis]
  DET -->|Problem| AGENT[Meta Muse reasoning agent - advisory only]
  AGENT --> POLICY[Policy engine validates bounded YAML patch]
  DET -->|Problem| POLICY
  POLICY -->|Approved| VERSION[Version configuration + preserve best checkpoint]
  VERSION -->|Next bounded attempt| KFP
  DET -->|Healthy/final| EVAL[Held-out evaluation + registry gate]
  TRAIN --> ART[(Checkpoint / artifact storage)]
  ART --> VERSION
  EVAL --> RELEASE[Approval then model promotion]
